			 (Amorgos, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				4.535
			</span></i> (Ephesus, <span class="entity">ii/iii A.D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Phil.</u>
