					85
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. δ᾽ ἐγὼ παρών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1288
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				299
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δίρκα τε . . ς. τ᾽ Ἀσωπιάδες κόραι</span>”
